<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">$</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> make</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> gen.defaultconfigs</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;"> # 生成iam-apiserver、iam-authz-server、iam-pump、iamctl组件的默认配置文件</span></span>
